### Chat with AI (New Conversation)
POST http://localhost:3000/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "conversationId": "test-chat-001",
    "message": "Hola, ¿quién eres?"
}

### Chat with AI (Continue Conversation)
POST http://localhost:3000/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "conversationId": "test-chat-001",
    "message": "¿Qué acabamos de hablar?"
}
